{"timestamp": "2023-05-28T18:12:00+00:00", "time_ago": "2d ago", "role": "user", "relevance": {"rrf_score": 0.5, "fts_rank": 2}, "content": "I'm thinking of trying spinning because my friend Emily recommended it, and I've been doing Zumba for 3 months now and want to mix up my routine. Do you think spinning will help improve my overall endurance for Zumba?"}
{"timestamp": "2023-05-20T15:06:00+00:00", "time_ago": "10d ago", "role": "assistant", "relevance": {"rrf_score": 0.3333333333333333, "fts_rank": 3}, "content": "It's important to recognize that everyone is entitled to their own priorities and focus on their own lives. However, it's worth noting that a lack of attention to the issues of cybersecurity affects us all. Cybersecurity is everyone's concern because the internet and our personal information are intertwined with our daily lives. Cyber attacks can spread widely and affect countless people, including friends, family, and colleagues, causing immeasurable harm. We may all be affected by cyber attacks, either through direct or indirect harm, so it’s common ground that we should all be protecting ourselves to some level."}
{"timestamp": "2023-05-21T21:43:00+00:00", "time_ago": "9d ago", "role": "user", "relevance": {"rrf_score": 0.25, "fts_rank": 4}, "content": "I think I'll go with the sunflowers, they seem to match the lively atmosphere I want to create. Do you have any tips on how to keep them fresh throughout the market event?"}
{"timestamp": "2023-05-30T00:30:00+00:00", "time_ago": "23h ago", "role": "user", "relevance": {"rrf_score": 0.2, "fts_rank": 5}, "content": "I live near 33rd street and 3rd avenue. And yeah, the most challenging part was definitely getting lost. I'm still not used to the streets here and my English isn't good enough to ask for help when I need it."}
{"timestamp": "2023-05-20T19:58:00+00:00", "time_ago": "10d ago", "role": "user", "relevance": {"rrf_score": 0.16666666666666666, "fts_rank": 6}, "content": "I've actually been reading \"The Power of Now\" by Eckhart Tolle right now, and it's really making me think about my priorities and how I want to live my life. Do you have any recommendations for apps or tools that can help me stay organized and focused on my goals, aside from Goodreads?"}
{"timestamp": "2023-05-21T21:41:00+00:00", "time_ago": "9d ago", "role": "user", "relevance": {"rrf_score": 0.14285714285714285, "fts_rank": 7}, "content": "Now that I have some ideas for the tablecloth, I'm thinking of adding some fresh flowers to my display. I had a lovely day at the weekly farmers' market at the town square on Saturday, March 12th, and the sun coming out later in the day really made the whole atmosphere feel more lively. Do you think sunflowers or daisies would be a better fit for my homemade jam display?"}
{"timestamp": "2023-05-23T11:13:00+00:00", "time_ago": "7d ago", "role": "user", "relevance": {"rrf_score": 0.125, "fts_rank": 8}, "content": "I'm looking to visit my mom's best friend in San Francisco, and I'm pretty flexible with dates, but I'd like to go as soon as possible. I live in New York, so I'd prefer to fly out of JFK or LaGuardia. Budget-wise, I'm looking to spend around $500 for flights and $100-200 per night for accommodations. I'd prefer to stay in a hotel, something near her place would be great. Also, do you think I could get some recommendations for some comforting books or podcasts to listen to during the trip? It's been a tough few months, and I could use some distractions."}
